WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:14.680 --> 00:00:15.760
Dude, chill.

00:00:16.380 --> 00:00:18.400
We're about to take out literally the biggest criminals in town.

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:20.880
Yes, and we are the biggest crime-fighting duo.

00:00:21.440 --> 00:00:22.900
Look, we just need to close the deal.

00:00:23.320 --> 00:00:25.880
Okay, we get in. We get the illegal merch, and then we scram.

00:00:39.940 --> 00:00:40.440
You Brett?

00:00:40.780 --> 00:00:41.480
That's me, man.

00:00:43.820 --> 00:00:44.720
You got what we're looking for?

00:00:45.320 --> 00:00:45.820
What's that?

00:00:47.060 --> 00:00:47.920
Serious firepower.

00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:49.900
Good.

00:00:59.360 --> 00:01:01.900
Check it out man, it's not gonna bite ya, c'mon.

00:01:04.340 --> 00:01:06.020
Now this is a point 9 mil.

00:01:06.980 --> 00:01:11.720
30 round mag. Now if you wanna start a war, you'll want this by your side.

00:01:12.900 --> 00:01:13.580
It's hella illegal, though.

00:01:14.520 --> 00:01:15.020
Very.

00:01:15.380 --> 00:01:16.300
So for my end of the deal?

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:23.360
Shit, man.

00:01:23.960 --> 00:01:25.400
For that much, you can have the whole lot of 'em!

00:01:26.260 --> 00:01:27.620
That's alright man, we just need one.

00:01:27.620 --> 00:01:29.280
Nah man, my crew's already locked and loaded, we're good.

00:01:29.700 --> 00:01:31.280
Hey, we'll take them.

00:01:35.080 --> 00:01:35.660
Alright.

00:01:36.340 --> 00:01:37.060
So we have a deal?

00:01:39.360 --> 00:01:40.920
Yeah, but my hands are full, though.

00:01:49.460 --> 00:01:50.020
Gotcha!

00:01:50.840 --> 00:01:53.160
Ahh, you son of a...

00:02:15.700 --> 00:02:16.320
I'm out of ammo!

00:02:19.300 --> 00:02:20.500
The hell am I supposed to do with that!?

00:02:41.260 --> 00:02:41.800
AH!

00:02:42.500 --> 00:02:43.380
OH, GOD!

00:02:51.560 --> 00:02:52.900
Hands up, you piece of trash!

00:03:04.920 --> 00:03:06.380
It's over, turn around!

00:03:22.400 --> 00:03:23.520
GUN!

00:03:28.740 --> 00:03:30.500
You killed my partner, you son of a bitch!

00:03:31.200 --> 00:03:32.380
What, you gonna kill me too?

00:03:33.260 --> 00:03:34.480
You don't have what it takes.

00:03:37.500 --> 00:03:39.500
I got better things in store for you.

00:03:52.580 --> 00:03:53.920
Great work, boys!

00:03:54.760 --> 00:03:56.620
Taking those boys out was no small fee.

00:03:56.940 --> 00:03:59.780
I knew I could count on the biggest cops to handle the biggest crime.

00:04:00.120 --> 00:04:00.860
Thanks a lot, chief.

00:04:01.840 --> 00:04:02.640
It means a lot to us.

00:04:02.640 --> 00:04:03.680
Yeah, well you know what?

00:04:04.440 --> 00:04:05.840
You boys should take the day off.

00:04:07.240 --> 00:04:07.780
That's an order!

00:04:15.440 --> 00:04:17.020
Whoaho! With that frame!

00:04:17.020 --> 00:04:19.400
It's supposed to be just a guy getting shot in the head

00:04:19.400 --> 00:04:21.720
But there is room for more creativity.

